OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy showers in the morning,
OL,6,Fgradually fading, with a few brighter
OL,7,Fand drier spells later. Another stormy
OL,8,Fday, with gales affecting some places
OL,9,Fand very strong gusts at times. The
OL,10,Fwind gradually eases by the evening,
OL,11,Fbut it remains breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBreezy with showers, mostly
OL,14,Facross the Pennines, clear spells
OL,15,Felsewhere. Clouding over later, with
OL,16,Flight rain across western parts by
OL,17,FMonday morning. The wind gradually
OL,18,Feases to a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
