OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy, with rain affecting
OL,6,Fmost places by mid-morning. The bulk
OL,7,Fof the rain clears during the
OL,8,Fafternoon, with clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping by the evening. Turning
OL,10,Fbreezy in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FRemaining breezy, with showers
OL,14,Faffecting some on Tuesday and
OL,15,FWednesday. Turning increasingly
OL,16,Fsettled, with lighter winds by
OL,17,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
